{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"SCREEN 640,480\n\nMUSIC PLAY \u0022Sound/Tracker/XM/Introghost.XM\u0022\n\nSPRITE LOAD 1,\u0022Graphics/Anim/Anim_SinTunnel_B15.png\u0022,500,480,15\nSPRITE POS 1,0,0\nSPRITE ZOOM 1,200,200\nSPRITE LAYER 1,1\nSPRITE ON 1\n\n; The tunnel\u0027s white stripes get rasters of their own: a band in the sprite\u0027s layer, shown only where it is white\nSCREEN SELECT 1\nRASTER 2,0,0,480,\u0022#FFFFFF,#9FE8FF,#3A7BFF,#7A2CFF,#3A7BFF,#9FE8FF,#FFFFFF\u0022\nRASTER WRAP 2,TRUE\nRASTER COLOUR 1,\u0022White\u0022,20\nSCREEN SELECT 0\n\nFONT LOAD 0, \u0022Graphics/font.png\u0022, 32, 25\nFONT MAP 0, \u0022ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ!?:;0123456789@()\u00A3$%.\u2019[]\u201D,-\u0022\nFONT ZOOM 0,200,200\nFONT PRINT  #2, 0, 0, 134, \u0022HELLO AMOS\u0022\nPARTICLE 3,100\n\nLOAD #3,\u0022Graphics/berg.png\u0022\n\nY=0 : F=0 : VX=0 : VY=45\n\nSCREEN SELECT 0\nWhile 1\n  \n  FONT ZOOM 0, 200, 200 ; Dubbel storlek\n\n  SPRITE POS 1,SIN(VX)*110,SIN(VY)*100\n  INC VY\n  VX = VX \u002B 1.5\n  IF VX\u003E359 THEN VX=0\n  IF VY\u003E359 THEN VY = 0\n  \n  SPRITE FRAME 1,F\n  INC F\n  IF F\u003E15 THEN F=0\n  \n  PARTICLE 1,40\n  RASTER 1,0,0,480,\u0022Red,Orange, Yellow, Green, Blue, Indigo, Violet, Red\u0022\n  RASTER WRAP 1,TRUE\n  \n  Y=Y-4\n  IF Y<0 THEN Y=Y+480\n  SCREEN SELECT 1\n  RASTER MOVE 2,Y\n  SCREEN SELECT 0\n  \n  WAIT VBL\nWEND"}